make sure the \u201cclient\u201d stays well and happy. Pick up some garbage along the way\u2014if you did drop him, just stitch him back together. Repair the casket along the way if a piece or two falls apart\u2014it\u2019s a fragile one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/extras/ragdoll_loop.gif?t=1743113111\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Through the Gloomy Cemetery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through the old cemetery, carefully walk the narrow bridges, avoid open graves, dodge the falling boulders, and watch out for the mysterious hands lurking in the dark\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>... and finally, this game was made in one month :)</i></p>","developers":["BROKENCIGS","fumigawa","ORIGAME DIGITAL"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553350/98227b0f72cb8b862413f1948d725538a1767a7a/header.jpg?t=1743113111","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 BROKENCIGS, LLC. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112106,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112106/movie480.mp4?t=1741993820","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112106/movie_max.mp4?t=1741993820"},"name":"The Hilltop Funeral Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257112106/05a1b6e9bbe2b022be4941570e0d790992c9ab3d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741993820","webm":{"480":"ht